Subject: [PATCH] AWGN event handling support

1. support to get the AWGN event in NL & whm HAL
2. process the event and forward it to channel selection task
3. Mark the preference for AWGN detected channel to 0 and set reason to 14

Signed-off-by: Sudharsan Eswaran <eswaran@qti.qualcomm.com>
